              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.11.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 11:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I hongo ma oro ma kerin jomaro kadh'iye lweny, Daudi ooro Yowab kodi jotel pa jolweny pere kodi jolweny ma Isiraili gibe; aka jokengila Joamon. To Daudi k'okadho i lweny, go odoŋ i Yerusalem. Jothoko Raba, jomonjo to jomako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi okwanyo sangaria pa Milkom were pa Joamon, m'oyido nitie gi zahabu ma romo kilo piero adek g'abic aka oyido nitie gi telin ma welo to ketho i sangaria pere. Daudi bende okelo gigipiny mathoth ma jonyaga wok i tindi madwoŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Go okelo ji ma Raba aka omiyo jo tic gi musimeno, kwe ma nyweny, le ma nyweny, aka omiyo jo goyo matafal. Otimo gime ri ji ma tindin pa Joamon man. Kenyo Daudi gi cwo pere jogik i Yerusalem.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.20.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Daudi gi cwo pere jolwenyo gi cwo Jofilistia ma jogaŋere",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rumacen ma gime, lweny obedo kendo gi Jofilistia i Gezer; kenyo ama Sibekay ma wok Husa oneko iye Jafilistia m'ogaŋere m'ilwoŋo ni Sipay.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.20.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
